<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-INTERVIEW-SHC sees tax decsion soon.</title>
<headline>RTRS-INTERVIEW-SHC sees tax decsion soon.</headline>
<byline>Kevin Morrison</byline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sydney Harbour Casino Holdings Ltd chief executive officer Neil Gamble said on Monday he expected to get a long awaited tax break for high spending gamblers from the New South Wales (NSW) government soon.</p>
<p>&quot;I expect an imminent decision from the government and I am quite confident that they will give the go ahead for a favourable tax regime,&quot; Gamble told Reuters in an interview.</p>
<p>Gamble said the NSW state government had told him they would be making their decision in the first quarter of 1997.</p>
</text>
